  "name": "Diagram Design",
  "summary": "Branded presentation diagrams (architecture, flowchart, sequence, ER, timeline, Sankey and 40+ more types) as HTML/SVG/PNG, with draw.io, Mermaid and Excalidraw import. OpenRA-adapted carry of the upstream skill; the recorded differences are in PROVENANCE.md inside the skill.",
